          "type": null,
          "body": "```\nC:\\Development\\wsbuild_2022>\n\n ** (wireshark:9504) 13:02:54.310301 [(none) ERROR] C:\\Development\\wireshark\\plugins\\epan\\transum\\extractors.c:121 -- extract_bool(): assertion failed: fvalue_type_ftenum(fv) == FT_BOOLEAN\n\n\nPress any key to exit\n```\n\nIt works. Is another commit planned to address the issue causing this?",
